OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAfter a dry
OL,6,Fstart with clear spells, cloud will
OL,7,Fspread south from the evening.
OL,8,FScattered showers, wintry at height,
OL,9,Fwill spread south from the evening.
OL,10,FBecoming breezy.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FCentral Belt largely dry
OL,13,Fwith spells of weak winter sunshine.
OL,14,FOver the north blustery showers at
OL,15,Ftimes, these wintry over high ground.
OL,16,FNortherly winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
