OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FLess
OL,6,Fcold from Friday. Mostly dry morning,
OL,7,Fwintry showers west Friday afternoon
OL,8,Finto Saturday morning. Outbreaks rain
OL,9,Fpass southeast Saturday afternoon,
OL,10,Fclearing before further rain pushes
OL,11,Fnortheast Sunday afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
